    Authorization: 'Bearer your-access-token'
  }
})
.then(response => {
  // Handle response here
})
.catch(error => {
  // Handle errors here
});
```

Make sure to replace `https://your-server.com/api/resource` with the actual URL of your resource, and `your-access-token` with the valid token issued by your server. If you haven't implemented authentication and authorization yet, you may need to consult your server documentation for details on how to obtain an access token.

If you continue facing issues after adding the Authorization header, it's possible that there's something else preventing the request from being authorized. In such cases, you might want to check your server logs or network traffic to see if there are any error messages or unusual activity that could shed light on the issue. Additionally, you could try making the same request using another HTTP client or tool, such as Postman or cURL, to see if the problem persists outside of Axios.

